stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> QUEUED : Producer starts render (FR-32)
  QUEUED --> PROCESSING : worker progress callback
  PROCESSING --> COMPLETED : callback with video URL (FR-34)
  QUEUED --> COMPLETED : completion callback before any progress callback (FR-34)
  QUEUED --> FAILED : worker unreachable or cancelled (FR-34)
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : worker error or cancelled (FR-33)
  FAILED --> QUEUED : automatic retry, attempts below 3 (FR-33)
  COMPLETED --> [*]
  FAILED --> [*] : attempts used up
